# Facts about Kael Dumont.

@fact kael.north
tier: surface
text: A transfer from the frozen North who arrived mid-term with frost in his eyelashes.

@fact kael.cold_hands
tier: personal
unlock: seen(kael_cold_hands) > 0
text: His hands are always cold. Nobody has ever been warm enough before.

@fact kael.sky
tier: personal
unlock: seen(astro_kael_roof) > 0
text: He watches a patch of sky with no stars in it: a star that eats light.

@fact kael.family
tier: secret
unlock: flag(kael_told)
text: His family serve something under the lake. They sent him to open its door; he came to stop them.

@fact kael.sister
tier: secret
unlock: flag(met_sister) or seen(ilse_village) > 0
text: He has a younger sister, Ilse, raised to do what he wouldn't.

@fact kael.mother
tier: personal
unlock: seen(kael_northern_lights) > 0
text: His mother never once said she was proud of him.

@fact kael.wanting
tier: secret
unlock: seen(kael_confession) > 0
text: He was taught not to want things, because wanting is how they control you.

@fact kael.thaw
tier: personal
unlock: seen(kael_until_the_thaw) > 0
text: In the North nobody says goodbye; it's unlucky. You say "until the thaw" and touch foreheads, so the cold knows you're coming back.
